ADDENDUM <Act No. 19768, Oct. 24, 2023>
Article 1 (Enforcement date)
This Act shall enter into force six months after the date of its promulgation; provided, Article 17 shall enter into force 3 years after the date of its promulgation.
Article 2 (Transitional measures concerning demonstration project operators)
A person who has entered into a contract, agreement, etc. with the Minister of Land, Infrastructure and Transport as a participant in a demonstration project before this Act enters into force shall be deemed to have obtained designation under Article 7(1).

